ck whether Brasileirao_Matches has missing scores at all broadly: home_goal empty. Let me count.\n\n3. 2016 mis-categorized: Brasília x Taguatinga (1-1, Jan 2016). Both teams have exactly 1 Série A 2016 match. Filter rule: in league competitions, drop matches where either team has < 5 matches in that comp+season. But careful — the filter must run AFTER dedup (post-load cleanup). Also for Série C 2014-2023: Série C has ~20 teams... teams play 19+ matches. If BR-Football Série C seasons are partial (1807 matches / 10 seasons = 180/season — Série C real format varies: 2014-2017 had 22 teams? Hmm 180/season is definitely partial or different format). If teams in Série C have < 5 matches... let me check the distribution before choosing threshold. Let me compute per (comp, season, team) counts and see the histogram for league comps.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05bba5de9001IymP3YIYNfzgRz","sessionID":"ses_fa45f1af7ffepwbxxISA0FiJ2d","messageID":"msg_05bb95f27001KX3J1436oQpIPH"}}
