dominated 2003 winning with ~100... Actually I'm not certain; novo is the only source; accept.\n\nCopa do Brasil now 1802 matches. Let me now also sanity-check head-to-head (Fla-Flu) and derbies, then player search, then move to the server. Also update `_replace_unscored` — it's now dead code path (probe catches via round key first), but keep it as a safety net for cases where the unscored match has no round/stage label (BR-Football unscored?). Fine.\n\nLet me now quickly validate:\n1. Fla-Flu head-to-head count.\n2. Libertadores finals.\n3. FIFA: \"Gabriel Barbosa\" search, \"Neymar Jr\".\n4. find_team('Palmeiras'), find_team('Atletico'), find_team('São Paulo'), find_team('Sport Club do Recife'), find_team('Athletico').","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05bc29571001aEvEzGm9ADSlAc","sessionID":"ses_fa45f1af7ffepwbxxISA0FiJ2d","messageID":"msg_05bc20778001KrpaYl5cWY32Pf"}}
